{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41468","headline":"细雨遥怀故人 · 李建勳","name":"细雨遥怀故人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江云未散东风暖，溟蒙正在高楼见。\n细柳缘堤少过人，平芜隔水时飞燕。\n我有近诗谁与和，忆君狂醉愁难破。\n昨夜南窗不得眠，闲堦点滴回灯坐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李建勳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41468.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41468","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}